Dialogue: 10,0:00:00.65,0:00:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Over here!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:01.77,0:00:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Here I go!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:02.77,0:00:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're slow!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:08.66,0:00:10.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Line up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.29,0:00:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm, what about Sasaki? Is she absent again today?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:16.61,0:00:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,The tournament is right around the corner.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.87,0:00:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kitamura. Go to the faculty room after practice.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.13,0:00:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.01,0:00:40.27,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(276,0)\be0.2\pos(290,110)\c&HEEEEEE&}Mayhem
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.81,0:00:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}You're going home unusually early today
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.35,0:00:45.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}so I thought we should drop by that café last time...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.90,0:00:48.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.35,0:00:48.27,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I'm Kitamura Kaori, the female tennis club president.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:48.76,0:00:53.51,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Sasaki Ami, a junior of mine has been\Nmissing our club practice lately.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.51,0:00:55.82,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna check up on her at her home.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:57.90,0:01:01.79,Alternate,,0,0,0,,We barely have time for dates.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:02.65,0:01:08.43,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I always cause trouble for Masaya-kun,\Nmy childhood friend and lover.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.44,0:01:12.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for all of this.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:13.58,0:01:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Masaya-kun.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.56,0:01:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well, right...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.10,0:01:21.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.28,0:01:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been hearing bad rumors about\Nthat second-year student Sasaki-san.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:26.50,0:01:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But she's been training in our\Ntennis club for more than a year.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:31.36,0:01:34.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I believe she will come back to us.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.41,0:01:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep things smooth.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:38.30,0:01:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I know. See you later.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.34,0:01:44.74,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Keep things smooth...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.01,0:01:48.25,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Smooth...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:00.95,0:02:04.79,Default,,0,0,0,,The intercom seems to be ringing. Should we leave it be?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:06.20,0:02:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, right when we're having a nice moment here...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:10.00,0:02:10.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:13.62,0:02:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:14.57,0:02:16.59,Default,,0,0,0,,My senior.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:16.59,0:02:19.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Our tennis club president.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:20.55,0:02:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I do, I'm no match for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:24.22,0:02:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Being around her just makes me feel really miserable.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.50,0:02:31.42,Alternate,,0,0,0,,That's it...
Dialogue: 10,0:02:33.35,0:02:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai, I'll hear you out inside if you wanna talk.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.34,0:02:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in first.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:44.93,0:02:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyways, this one is a fuck buddy.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:49.14,0:02:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He's Ryou-kun, a friend of mine.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.87,0:02:55.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We're having sex after school.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:55.87,0:02:59.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care about our club anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:01.64,0:03:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, Sasaki-san! Are you out of\Nyour mind? What are you doing!?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.84,0:03:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.39,0:03:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Your face is beet red, Senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:13.85,0:03:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it be that you don't have\Nany experience in this yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.13,0:03:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.94,0:03:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Ami... How about having her\Njoin us in a threesome?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.64,0:03:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let me go! Nooo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.97,0:03:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's a great idea.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:32.94,0:03:36.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Senpai, this guy is very good at it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.95,0:03:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooo!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.90,0:03:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's okay. To make it not hurt...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.57,0:03:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure to do stuff like this for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.13,0:04:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Stop doing this!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.25,0:04:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at your nipples.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.53,0:04:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,They are starting to get harder.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.41,0:04:18.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're so stiff.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:19.84,0:04:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean this one's the same?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.49,0:04:32.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, I was right.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:32.46,0:04:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're totally feeling good now.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.97,0:04:41.09,Alternate,,0,0,0,,My body feels limp.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:41.09,0:04:44.11,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I can't think straight.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.11,0:04:46.71,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I can't fight back!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.37,0:04:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa... It's so stringy!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.59,0:04:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooooooo!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.10,0:04:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, looking good!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:58.98,0:05:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to hold back any longer!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.86,0:05:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,N-No!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.49,0:05:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Huh!?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.11,0:05:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I don't wanna... I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.87,0:05:19.06,Alternate,,0,0,0,,No, I don't want this!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.10,0:05:23.92,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Masaya-kun, help me!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:32.75,0:05:38.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Kaori-senpai. Aren't you close to a certain guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.25,0:05:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,One look and I can tell he's sort of a late bloomer.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:42.33,0:05:45.63,Default,,0,0,0,,He hasn't put his hands on you yet, just as I expected.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:47.67,0:05:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Over here, Senpai. Let's take a photo\Nto commemorate your defloration.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.66,0:05:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? You're resisting.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:57.49,0:06:00.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I wanna see.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:01.60,0:06:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,A face that says "I'm a slut who loves sex"
Dialogue: 10,0:06:05.56,0:06:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,is what I'm looking for.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.42,0:06:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then how about you use that stuff of yours?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.26,0:06:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, that's it! Let's do that!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.45,0:06:21.65,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my favorite cream.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:22.13,0:06:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll put some on you as well, Senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.20,0:06:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.05,0:06:33.11,Alternate,,0,0,0,,What is this sensation? Itchy?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.11,0:06:36.41,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Or rather... Hot!?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.31,0:06:42.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this!? N-Nooo!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.46,0:06:48.62,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I'm scared. I feel an unusual heat\Nslowly spreading in my body.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.62,0:06:51.43,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I'm scared... I'm scared!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:52.33,0:06:58.17,Default,,0,0,0,,This cream is used to make horses and cows go in heat.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.17,0:07:00.31,Alternate,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.31,0:07:02.82,Alternate,,0,0,0,,She rubbed such a thing on me!?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.34,0:07:15.12,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Wh-What should I do? It was painful up until now...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.54,0:07:19.67,Alternate,,0,0,0,,...but I'm feeling good now.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:19.67,0:07:23.29,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I can't get enough of this pleasure!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.24,0:07:27.90,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes... That face...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.35,0:07:31.68,Alternate,,0,0,0,,An honor student like you
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.68,0:07:35.49,Alternate,,0,0,0,,falls from grace and becomes a slave to cocks...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.78,0:07:39.76,Alternate,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been looking for.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:43.39,0:07:45.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How about coming inside her?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.23,0:07:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,For real? Lucky me!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.01,0:07:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,No, absolutely not! Nooo!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.43,0:07:55.53,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.30,0:08:00.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ami got some pills.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.38,0:08:08.70,Alternate,,0,0,0,,It's no use. My body has no strength.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.33,0:08:12.50,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I don't want this.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:13.34,0:08:17.72,Alternate,,0,0,0,,He forces himself on me,\Nonly to end up coming inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.14,0:08:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.93,0:08:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything but inside me...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.48,0:08:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, you still have some sense of reason left?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.27,0:08:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you more, then.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.10,0:08:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna put lots of it in your asshole as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:56.80,0:09:01.81,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Here it comes... I can feel something crazy...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.70,0:09:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm coming...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.15,0:09:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Ugh... He said he'd wait an hour more in the park.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.86,0:09:25.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Your boyfriend is slow on the uptake.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:25.28,0:09:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I should tell him to go home already.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:30.45,0:09:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, isn't it the opposite?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:32.94,0:09:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't her boyfriend suspicious of you instead?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.41,0:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, look at what you did to her.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.41,0:09:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Ohh? I see...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:44.35,0:09:50.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,1474)}In that case, keeping him in the loop here\Nwould prevent any suspicions.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.31,0:09:58.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kaori...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.06,0:10:02.72,Default,,0,0,0,,...and Sasaki-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.74,0:10:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked Kaori-senpai
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.14,0:10:10.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and she told me her boyfriend was waiting for her.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:10.24,0:10:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know and ended up\Nkeeping her this long. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.67,0:10:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaori... Are you alright? Your face is flushed.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.02,0:10:26.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh? Ah... Am I?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:29.86,0:10:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh, Kaori-senpai. I'll say it.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.74,0:10:40.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is my grades sharply dropped
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.35,0:10:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm unable to join our club activities.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.87,0:10:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But Kaori-senpai said she'd help me study.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.42,0:10:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So that's what happened...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.12,0:10:58.23,Alternate,,0,0,0,,On this day, Kaori and I basically\Nstopped going home together.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.77,0:11:02.63,Alternate,,0,0,0,,After her club practice, Sasaki-san would show up
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.53,Alternate,,0,0,0,,and they'd straight up go to their study group.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.98,0:11:09.54,Alternate,,0,0,0,,To be honest, this makes me feel lonely.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.54,0:11:12.31,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Of course, I'd love to support her.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.67,0:11:17.24,Alternate,,0,0,0,,But today is supposed to be a special day.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:23.44,0:11:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, this ointment is almost empty.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:27.41,0:11:29.87,Default,,0,0,0,,We ran through it so fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.04,0:11:33.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:33.36,0:11:37.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go just for today...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.67,0:11:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Ehh?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.78,0:11:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Masaya-kun's birthday today...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.30,0:11:45.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So please...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.59,0:11:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What a bother.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.43,0:11:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,But well, if that's the case...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.95,0:11:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me outside for a bit.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:01.23,0:12:07.08,Default,,0,0,0,,If you beat me, our study group will be over today!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.45,0:12:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.85,0:12:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that fun?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.36,0:12:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the best! I can't help but laugh here!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:18.88,0:12:21.69,Alternate,,0,0,0,,They will set me free if I win.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.24,0:12:23.70,Alternate,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.50,0:12:29.32,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I-I have to wear this thing!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.98,0:12:35.75,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I still feel hot from the drug earlier!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.02,0:12:45.49,Default,,0,0,0,,There, too bad for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:50.41,0:12:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, hang in there!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:52.00,0:12:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh!?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.10,0:12:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Show me the willpower of an ace player!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.58,0:13:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my, I defeated the national-level top ace player.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:15.07,0:13:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,It sure feels great.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.61,0:13:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well then, I won the match.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.08,0:13:25.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That means the study group continues.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.19,0:13:31.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You can go to your boyfriend now, Senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.93,0:13:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I am going home
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.42,0:13:39.54,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm getting screwed by Ryou-kun's cock with all might.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:39.80,0:13:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Please feel free to go, Senpai.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:42.46,0:13:46.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a fun talk with your boyfriend or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.80,0:13:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,U-Umm...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:55.90,0:13:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels good!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.20,0:14:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow, this feels amazing...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.71,0:14:10.51,Default,,0,0,0,,They won't stop! My hips won't stop!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:14.58,0:14:19.46,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I've always been with Kaori on my birthdays, though...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:24.49,0:14:25.86,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Kaori...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.47,Alternate,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Kaori!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:29.96,0:14:33.83,Alternate,,0,0,0,,Masaya-kun, I'm sorry!
